{"id":"n60096-1-17","stage":1,"title":"관심 · 关注","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60096-1-17-1","ko":"내일부터 수영을 배워 보지 않을래?","zh":"从明天开始学游泳怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일부터","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수영을","meaning":"游泳","explanation":"수영：游泳；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"수영","audio":"/audio/a2fcc3f1c53a37caae9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64611","senseId":"1","lemma":"수영","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배워","meaning":"学，学习","explanation":"배우다：学，学习；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"배우다","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62088","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보지","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않을래?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；을래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"a2fcc3f1c53a37ca","term":"수영","zh":"游泳","audio":"/audio/a2fcc3f1c53a37caae9b.mp3","entryId":"64611","definition":"在水中游行。","pronunciation":["수영"]},{"id":"2c65351237177855","term":"배우다","zh":"学，学习","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3","entryId":"62088","definition":"获得新知识。","pronunciation":["배우다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/97f9464466b4b785afdf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60096-1-17-2","ko":"싫어요, 엄마. 저는 운동에는 정말 관심이 없다니까요!","zh":"不要啦，妈妈。我就说我对运动真的没兴趣啊！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"싫어요,","meaning":"不愿意，不想","explanation":"싫다：不愿意，不想；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"싫다","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57271","senseId":"2","lemma":"싫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄마.","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"운동에는","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"관심이","meaning":"关注，关心，兴趣","explanation":"관심：关注，关心，兴趣；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"관심","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60096","senseId":"1","lemma":"관심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없다니까요!","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；다니까요：礼貌地再次强调已经说过的内容。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2011ef2922f6c340","term":"싫다","zh":"不愿意，不想","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3","entryId":"57271","definition":"不情愿做某事。","pronunciation":["실타"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"07b3c15a29688a55","term":"관심","zh":"关注，关心，兴趣","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3","entryId":"60096","definition":"被某种东西吸引的情感和想法。","pronunciation":["관심"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/241e1a89e577bdd82423.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.428,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60096","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":38,"sequenceScore":1.7868,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不要啦，妈妈。我就说我对运动真的没兴趣啊！","看起来心情很好啊，发生了什么事？","从明天开始学游泳怎么样？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不要啦，妈妈。我就说我对运动真的没兴趣啊！","从明天开始学游泳怎么样？","看起来心情很好啊，发生了什么事？"],"answer":0}]}
